      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.92,
      "end_seconds": 9.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.31,
      "end_seconds": 23.09,
      "duration_seconds": 12.78,
      "text": "Mainly breathlessness months after the infection. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.82,
      "end_seconds": 27.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.58,
      "end_seconds": 42.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.23,
      "end_seconds": 73.55,
      "duration_seconds": 11.32,
      "text": "Okay: height 162 centimetres, saturation 97 percent. And respiratory rate 15, BMI works out to 29.0, weight 76 kilos, pressure 108 over 80, pulse 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.18,
      "end_seconds": 76.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.71,
      "end_seconds": 81.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.27,
      "end_seconds": 98.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.48,
      "end_seconds": 102.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "ever since... since Friday, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.76,
      "end_seconds": 108.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.8,
      "end_seconds": 118.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, out of ten. I've had brain fog too, you know, for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.12,
      "end_seconds": 123.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "any coughing up blood or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.25,
      "end_seconds": 127.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.33,
      "end_seconds": 131.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Did you get leg swelling or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.46,
      "end_seconds": 138.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "No leg swelling or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.54,
      "end_seconds": 142.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.71,
      "end_seconds": 145.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.41,
      "end_seconds": 159.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.43,
      "end_seconds": 163.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "No, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.31,
      "end_seconds": 167.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.66,
      "end_seconds": 174.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Uh, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.65,
      "end_seconds": 178.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.19,
      "end_seconds": 181.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.96,
      "end_seconds": 190.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Alright, do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.66,
      "end_seconds": 196.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.0,
      "end_seconds": 200.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.99,
      "end_seconds": 203.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.71,
      "end_seconds": 222.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.36,
      "end_seconds": 236.54,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.07,
      "end_seconds": 243.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.22,
      "end_seconds": 246.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.97,
      "end_seconds": 249.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.96,
      "end_seconds": 272.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "Your oxygen is normal at rest and after walking and your chest is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.4,
      "end_seconds": 278.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.17,
      "end_seconds": 300.9,
      "duration_seconds": 11.73,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? I'd lean towards post-viral symptoms after COVID i want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.6,
      "end_seconds": 306.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "right, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.1,
      "end_seconds": 326.15,
      "duration_seconds": 19.05,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's post-viral symptoms after COVID, and we'll know more once the a chest X-ray is back just to be sure I understood you've had breathlessness months after the infection, since Friday, and no chest pain or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.71,
      "end_seconds": 328.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "exactly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.07,
      "end_seconds": 347.33,
      "duration_seconds": 17.26,
      "text": "A chest X-ray is what I'd like next, for persistent breathlessness. I want blood tests done, that's for post-viral fatigue. Pace your activity and increase it slowly each week. Let's plan a check in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.39,
      "end_seconds": 351.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.36,
      "end_seconds": 357.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.18,
      "end_seconds": 363.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Good, you know, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
